    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d969">

                <pb facs="1008" n="996" sameAs="frus:frus1945v08/pg996"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.90F27/12–3145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Saudi Arabia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Eddy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Jidda</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-31T12:00:00+03:06">December 31,
                            1945—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 4:42 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>446. Deptel 380, December 29. Foreign Minister is still in Mecca with King and
                    will return to Jidda late today. I shall immediately <pb facs="1009" n="997"
                        xml:id="pg997"/> press for inclusion of 6 months’ notice in SAG (Saudi
                    Arabian Govt) written reply.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Eddy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
